@startuml
title Sensor Node and MQTT Communication

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 14

rectangle "RFID-Tagged\nHospital Asset" as Asset

package "Sensor Node Layer" {
    component "Registration Desk Node\nESP32 + RFID Reader" as RegNode
    component "Checkpoint Node\nESP32 + RFID Reader" as CheckNode
}

cloud "Hospital Wi-Fi" as WiFi
cloud "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
component "Backend MQTT Service" as MQTTService

Asset --> RegNode : UHF RFID scan
Asset --> CheckNode : UHF RFID detection

RegNode --> WiFi : Wi-Fi connection
CheckNode --> WiFi : Wi-Fi connection

WiFi --> MQTT : Network transport

RegNode --> MQTT : Registration scan\nHeartbeat\nAcknowledgement
CheckNode --> MQTT : RFID detection\nHeartbeat\nAcknowledgement

MQTT --> MQTTService : Deliver node events

MQTTService --> MQTT : Publish blink or\nsupported command
MQTT --> RegNode : Deliver command
MQTT --> CheckNode : Deliver command

note bottom of MQTTService
The backend validates the MQTT topic,
node identity, event type, and payload
before updating system data.
end note

@enduml